        ["Three days after total knee arthroplasty, a patient has 65 degrees of knee flexion and is anxious about moving. What is the PRIMARY reason to emphasize early knee motion?", ["To reduce the risk of arthrofibrosis and stiffness", "To speed bone healing around the implant", "To lower the risk of implant loosening", "To prevent the quadriceps tendon from shortening"], "Early motion after TKA reduces scar-related stiffness. Motion is not primarily aimed at bone healing or loosening."]
